# Dragons EVO -- PUBLIC first-download repo (dragons-evo-client).
#
# This is where a player gets the client the first time. It tracks the exes
# (DragonsEVO_*.exe, ~15-20 MB each), the DLLs, and -- see below -- data.zip. It is
# generated by tools/client-release/build_client_release.py. There is NO loose client tree
# and NO signed manifest here (those live in the private updater repo).

# --- secrets / source: must never be here ---
/src/
resourcecryptkey.h
antibotsecret.h
*.cpp
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.*
*.sln
*.props
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
*.pdb

# --- data.zip is ~484 MB (the encrypted Tibia.spr is high-entropy and does not compress)
#     and exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file push limit. Default: keep it OUT of git and
#     publish it as a GitHub RELEASE ASSET -- the build script prints the exact `gh release`
#     command. Players download the exe/DLLs from the repo and data.zip from Releases. ---
data.zip
#   To version data.zip WITH the repo via Git LFS instead, delete the "data.zip" line above,
#   then once per clone:  git lfs install --local && git lfs track data.zip
#   (LFS re-uploads the full ~484 MB on every sprite release -- mind the LFS storage/bandwidth quota.)

# --- build scratch ---
.stage-client-release/
*.tmp

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
